% The note stack — the key-value cache, told as sticky notes.
% Show: word-5 state (bricks + their sticky notes in a tray) -> word 6
% arrives -> it READS the whole stack (orange: one sweep left, every note
% lights up) -> it WRITES its own note (red: straight down into the empty
% slot): the cache grows by exactly one entry. Read and write are drawn as
